{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`EDU`,`title`:`New Girl at Lotus School`,`titleVN`:`C\u00f4 b\u1ea1n m\u1edbi \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1eddng Hoa Sen`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Trang`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 b\u00e9 15 tu\u1ed5i t\u1eeb Hu\u1ebf ra, chuy\u1ec3n tr\u01b0\u1eddng gi\u1eefa n\u0103m, ch\u0103m ch\u1ec9 nh\u01b0ng thi\u1ebfu t\u1ef1 tin`},{`name`:`Mr Long`,`vn`:`th\u1ea7y Long, 35 tu\u1ed5i, d\u1ea1y to\u00e1n \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1eddng Hoa Sen, nghi\u00eam m\u00e0 vui`},{`name`:`Quoc`,`vn`:`Qu\u1ed1c, 15 tu\u1ed5i, b\u1ea1n ng\u1ed3i c\u1ea1nh Trang, hay \u0111\u00f9a nh\u01b0ng th\u00f4ng minh b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:2,`parts`:2,`title`:`Reading and Writing`,`titleVN`:`\u0110\u1ecdc v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft`,`words`:`spell|spelling|read|write|paragraph|writing|reading|sentence|skill|practice|practise|university|library|dictionary|course|college|test|exam`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[The]] [[next]] [[morning]], [[the]] [[first]] [[lesson]] [[is|be]] English. \`[[Who]] [[can]] [[spell]] '[[beautiful]]'?\` [[asks|ask]] [[the]] [[teacher]]. Quoc [[tries|try]], [[but]] [[he]] [[forgets|forget]] [[the]] [[letter]] [[A]]. Trang [[spells|spell]] [[it]] [[right]]. [[Spelling]] [[is|be]] [[easy]] [[for]] [[her]]. [[She]] [[reads|read]] [[a]] [[lot]].`,`vn`:`S\u00e1ng h\u00f4m sau, ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 ti\u1ebfng Anh. \`Ai \u0111\u00e1nh v\u1ea7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1eef 'beautiful'?\` c\u00f4 gi\u00e1o h\u1ecfi. Qu\u1ed1c th\u1eed, nh\u01b0ng qu\u00ean m\u1ea5t ch\u1eef A. Trang \u0111\u00e1nh v\u1ea7n \u0111\u00fang. V\u1edbi c\u00f4, \u0111\u00e1nh v\u1ea7n d\u1ec5 th\u00f4i. C\u00f4 \u0111\u1ecdc r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u.`},{`en`:`[[After]] [[school]], Trang [[goes|go]] [[to]] Mr Long's [[room]]. \`[[Read]] [[this]] [[page]] [[to]] [[me]], [[please]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Now]] [[write]] [[a]] [[paragraph]] [[about]] [[your]] [[city]].\` Trang [[writes|write]] [[a]] [[short]] [[paragraph]] [[about]] Hue. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[about]] [[the]] [[river]], [[the]] [[rain]] [[and]] [[her]] [[grandmother's|grandmother]] [[house]].`,`vn`:`Tan h\u1ecdc, Trang l\u00ean ph\u00f2ng th\u1ea7y Long. \`Em \u0111\u1ecdc trang n\u00e0y cho th\u1ea7y nghe nh\u00e9,\` th\u1ea7y n\u00f3i. \`Gi\u1edd em vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n v\u0103n v\u1ec1 th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a em.\` Trang vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t \u0111o\u1ea1n ng\u1eafn v\u1ec1 Hu\u1ebf, k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 d\u00f2ng s\u00f4ng, nh\u1eefng c\u01a1n m\u01b0a v\u00e0 ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1ee7a b\u00e0.`},{`en`:`Mr Long [[reads|read]] [[her]] [[writing]]. \`[[Your]] [[reading]] [[is|be]] [[good]], [[and]] [[your]] [[writing]] [[is|be]] [[beautiful]]. [[But]] [[your]] [[sentences|sentence]] [[are|be]] [[very]] [[short]]. [[Why]]?\` Trang [[looks|look]] [[down]]. \`Long [[sentences|sentence]] [[have]] [[more]] [[mistakes|mistake]].\` Mr Long [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[Mistakes|mistake]] [[are|be]] [[good]] [[teachers|teacher]].\``,`vn`:`Th\u1ea7y Long \u0111\u1ecdc b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a c\u00f4. \`Em \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1ed1t, v\u00e0 em vi\u1ebft r\u1ea5t hay. Nh\u01b0ng c\u00e2u c\u1ee7a em ng\u1eafn qu\u00e1. Sao v\u1eady?\` Trang nh\u00ecn xu\u1ed1ng. \`C\u00e2u d\u00e0i th\u00ec d\u1ec5 sai h\u01a1n \u1ea1.\` Th\u1ea7y Long b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Sai l\u1ea7m l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ea7y t\u1ed1t m\u00e0.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Reading]] [[and]] [[writing]] [[are|be]] [[skills|skill]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Skills|skill]] [[need]] [[practice]]. [[Practise]] [[a]] [[little]] [[every]] [[day]].\` \`I'll [[try]] [[again]],\` [[says|say]] Trang. \`[[Good]]. [[Do]] [[you]] [[want]] [[to]] [[go]] [[to]] [[university]]?\` \`[[Yes]]. [[I]] [[want]] [[to]] [[teach]], [[like]] [[you]].\``,`vn`:`\`\u0110\u1ecdc v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft l\u00e0 k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng,\` th\u1ea7y n\u00f3i. \`K\u1ef9 n\u0103ng th\u00ec ph\u1ea3i luy\u1ec7n. M\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y em luy\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat.\` \`Em s\u1ebd th\u1eed l\u1ea1i \u1ea1,\` Trang n\u00f3i. \`T\u1ed1t. Sau n\u00e0y em c\u00f3 mu\u1ed1n h\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc kh\u00f4ng?\` \`C\u00f3 \u1ea1. Em mu\u1ed1n \u0111i d\u1ea1y, gi\u1ed1ng th\u1ea7y.\``},{`en`:`[[Outside]], Quoc [[takes|take]] [[her]] [[to]] [[the]] [[library]] [[at]] [[number]] 6. [[Old]] Mr Phuc [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[them]] [[over]] [[his]] [[glasses|glass]]. \`[[Quiet]], [[please]].\` Trang [[finds|find]] [[a]] [[big]] [[dictionary]]. Quoc [[finds|find]] [[a]] [[book]] [[of]] [[funny]] [[stories|story]] [[and]] [[laughs|laugh]] [[out]] [[loud]]. \`[[Quiet]], [[please]]!\` [[says|say]] Mr Phuc [[again]].`,`vn`:`Ra ngo\u00e0i, Qu\u1ed1c d\u1eabn c\u00f4 \u0111\u1ebfn th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n \u1edf s\u1ed1 6. \u00d4ng Ph\u00fac nh\u00ecn hai \u0111\u1ee9a qua c\u1eb7p k\u00ednh. \`Gi\u1eef tr\u1eadt t\u1ef1 n\u00e0o.\` Trang t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed1n t\u1eeb \u0111i\u1ec3n d\u00e0y. Qu\u1ed1c t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed1n truy\u1ec7n c\u01b0\u1eddi v\u00e0 c\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u00e1 l\u00ean. \`Gi\u1eef tr\u1eadt t\u1ef1 n\u00e0o!\` \u00f4ng Ph\u00fac l\u1ea1i nh\u1eafc.`},{`en`:`\`[[My]] [[brother]] [[does|do]] [[a]] [[cooking]] [[course]] [[at]] [[college]],\` [[says|say]] Quoc. \`[[Every]] [[day]] [[he]] [[brings|bring]] [[his]] [[homework]] [[home]], [[and]] [[I]] [[eat]] [[it]].\``,`vn`:`\`Anh t\u1edb h\u1ecdc m\u1ed9t kh\u00f3a n\u1ea5u \u0103n \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1eddng cao \u0111\u1eb3ng,\` Qu\u1ed1c k\u1ec3. \`Ng\u00e0y n\u00e0o anh \u1ea5y c\u0169ng mang b\u00e0i t\u1eadp v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0, v\u00e0 t\u1edb \u0103n s\u1ea1ch.\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[next]] [[day]], Mr Long [[has|have]] [[news]]. \`[[On]] [[Monday]], [[we]] [[have]] [[our]] [[first]] [[test]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[the]] [[big]] [[exam]] [[in]] [[June]], [[but]] [[it]] [[is|be]] [[important]].\` Quoc [[puts|put]] [[his]] [[head]] [[on]] [[the]] [[desk]]. Trang [[opens|open]] [[her]] [[books|book]].`,`vn`:`H\u00f4m sau, th\u1ea7y Long c\u00f3 tin b\u00e1o. \`Th\u1ee9 Hai n\u00e0y, l\u1edbp m\u00ecnh l\u00e0m b\u00e0i ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. \u0110\u00e2y ch\u01b0a ph\u1ea3i k\u1ef3 thi l\u1edbn v\u00e0o th\u00e1ng S\u00e1u, nh\u01b0ng r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng.\` Qu\u1ed1c g\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ea7u xu\u1ed1ng b\u00e0n. Trang m\u1edf s\u00e1ch ra h\u1ecdc.`}],`tease`:`B\u00e0i ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1edbi s\u1ebd ra sao?`}]}